      "message": "Hi Amit,\nin the factory we flash the device before we attach a battery.  In this process we will be batteryless, powered only by USB-C and the flashing will do the equivalent of a cold reboot when the flashing process is done.  All of the other TCPCs will brown out and reboot when we go into this OPEN/OPEN condition.  NCT gets in a state of not dropping CC so Vbus continues to be active and we lock up more than reboot.  I was hoping to get the NCT to react like the other TCPCs so I didn\u0027t have to add special code for the basic reboot mechanism.\nThank you for the information.  I will give that a shot tomorrow.",
